base resource. \nThis phenomenon seems pointing to A same editor problem as in #113177 and #66987 . \nBut since _to always open one issue for one bug_ I opened this issue. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the mrp. \nSee the files. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-icon-missing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23772649/mrp-icon-missing.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}